imum (3:1 for large text, 4.5:1 otherwise)?","yes":"The largest text passes its minimum.","w":5,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Does the largest text reach its WCAG minimum (3:1 for large text, 4.5:1 otherwise)? Yes means: The largest text passes its minimum.","pushes":null,"fix":"Raise the headline contrast to at least 3:1."},{"meter":"contrast","id":"c_size","q":"Is the largest text at least 1.8 times the body text size?","yes":"Size separates the headline from the body.","w":14,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the largest text at least 1.8 times the body text size? Yes means: Size separates the headline from the body.","pushes":null,"fix":"Make the headline at least 1.8 times the body text size."},{"meter":"contrast","id":"c_weight","q":"Is the headline or emphasised text set in a heavier weight than the body text?","yes":"Stroke weight separates emphasis from body.","w":13,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the headline or emphasised text set in a heavier weight than the body text? Yes means: Stroke weight separates emphasis from body.","pushes":null,"fix":"Set the headline in a heavier weight than the body text."},{"meter":"contrast","id":"c_space","q":"Is the space between groups clearly larger than the space inside them?","yes":"Spacing separates groups.","w":13,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the space between groups clearly larger than the space inside them? Yes means: Spacing separates groups.","pushes":null,"fix":"Leave more space between groups than between the lines inside a group."},{"meter":"familiar","id":"f_logo","q":"Is the logo or site name in the top-left (or top-center) of the screen?","yes":"Logo sits in the top 15% and left half or center.","w":17,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the logo or site name in the top-left (or top-center) of the screen? Yes means: Logo sits in the top 15% and left half or center.","pushes":null,"fix":"Move the logo to the top-