ords or the company's own product names (Log in, Pricing, Contact, Cart, Search, Mac, iPad)?","yes":"Most labels are common words.","w":14,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Do nav and button labels use common words or the company's own product names (Log in, Pricing, Contact, Cart, Search, Mac, iPad)?","pushes":null,"fix":"Rename the unusual nav labels to common words."},{"meter":"familiar","id":"f_odd","q":"Is the page free of unusual patterns (rotated text, hidden or icon-only nav, custom scroll, text on busy images)?","yes":"None appear.","w":11,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the page free of unusual patterns (rotated text, hidden or icon-only nav, custom scroll, text on busy images)? Yes means: None appear.","pushes":null,"fix":""},{"meter":"ease","id":"E1","q":"Does the page use 6 or fewer different text sizes?","yes":"6 or fewer text sizes.","w":12,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Does the page use 6 or fewer different text sizes?","pushes":null,"fix":"Cut the page down to six text sizes or fewer."},{"meter":"ease","id":"E2","q":"Do the text colors use 3 or fewer different hues (greys and black/white do not count)?","yes":"Distinct fg hues on elements, ignoring greys, is 3 or fewer.","w":12,"kind":"code","jev":"","pushes":null,"fix":"Limit text colours to one accent hue plus neutral greys."},{"meter":"ease","id":"E4","q":"Are there 120 or fewer visible words on the screen?","yes":"word_count_visible is 120 or fewer.","w":5,"kind":"code","jev":"","pushes":null,"fix":"Show the highlights first and let people open the detail as they navigate."},{"meter":"ease","id":"E5","q":"Is every line of text 80 characters or fewer?","yes":"No line is longer than 80 characters.","w":7,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is every line of text 80 characters or fewer?","pushes":null,"fix":"Narrow the text column so lines hold 80 characters or fewer."},{"meter":"ease","id":"E6","q":"Are there 10 or fewer boxed or bordered panels?","yes":"panel_count (boxes with a visible border or fill) is 10 or fewer.","w":14,"kind":"jev","jev":"The page has 10 or fewer boxes, cards or panels with visible borders or fills.","pushes":null,"fix":"Show fewer panels at first and reveal the rest as people navigate."},{"meter":"ease","id":"E7","q":"Does all text sit on a flat, single-color background?","yes":"No text sits on a photo, pattern or gradient.","w":12,"kind":"jev","jev":"All text on the page sits on a flat single-color background, not on a photo, pattern or gradient.","pushes":null,"fix":"Put a solid colour behind the text that sits on a photo or gradient."},{"meter":"ease","id":"E9","q":"Is the smallest text at least 60% of the body text size?","yes":"No text is much smaller than the body text.","w":12,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the smallest text at least 60% of the body text size? Yes means: No text is much smaller than the body text.","pushes":null,"fix":""},{"meter":"ease","id":"E10","q":"Is the body text no more than 7 times smaller than the headline?","yes":"Body text holds its size next to the headline.","w":10,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the body text no more than 7 times smaller than the headline? Yes means: Body text holds its size next to the headline.","pushes":null,"fix":"Set the body text larger relative to the headline."},{"meter":"clarity","id":"C1","q":"Is there exactly one primary button (the most filled, most contrasting button)?","yes":"Exactly 1 element in buttons[] has primary=true.","w":15,"kind":"jev","jev":"There is exactly one primary button, and it is clearly the strongest button on the page.","pushes":null,"fix":"Turn every filled button except the main one into an outline button."},{"meter":"clarity","id":"C2","q":"Is the primary button label 1-4 words and does it start with a verb?","yes":"Label like 'Sign up' or 'Start free trial' (verb first, 4 words or fewer).","w":7,"kind":"jev","jev":"The label on the primary button is 1 to 4 words long and starts with a verb.","pushes":null,"fix":"Rewrite the main button label as verb plus object, four words or fewer."},{"meter":"clarity","id":"C3","q":"Is the primary button visible without scrolling?","yes":"primary button bbox lies inside the screenshot.","w":12,"kind":"jev","jev":"The primary button is visible in the screenshot without scrolling.","pushes":null,"fix":"Move the main button into the first screen."},{"meter":"clarity","id":"C4","q":"Are there 7 or fewer nav items visible at once?","yes":"Count of nav elements is 7 or fewer.","w":8,"kind":"code","jev":"","pushes":null,"fix":""},{"meter":"clarity","id":"C5","q":"Are there 15 or fewer clickable things on the whole screen?","yes":"options (links + buttons + inputs) is 15 or fewer.","w":3,"kind":"code","jev":"","pushes":null,"fix":""},{"meter":"clarity","id":"C6","q":"Does the headline say what the product is or does, in plain words (no slogan or metaphor)?","yes":"A stranger could finish 'This is a ... that lets me ...' from the headline.","w":15,"kind":"jev","jev":"The headline says in plain words what the product is or does, without a slogan or metaphor.","pushes":null,"fix":""},{"meter":"clarity","id":"C7","q":"Does every link and button look clickable (fill, border, underline or a different color from body text)?","yes":"No clickable item looks like plain body text.","w":12,"kind":"jev","jev":"Every link and button on the page looks clickable: it has a fill, border, underline or a color different from body text.","pushes":null,"fix":"Underline text links and give buttons a fill or border."},{"meter":"clarity","id":"C8","q":"Is the space around the primary button free of banners, ads or pop-ups?","yes":"No banner, ad, pop-up or second promo sits within one button-height of the primary button.","w":5,"kind":"jev","jev":"Nothing competes with the primary button: no banner, ad, pop-up or second promo sits next to it.","pushes":null,"fix":""},{"meter":"clarity","id":"C9",