e than 4 different text/accent colors on screen?","yes":"5 or more distinct hues","w":12,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Are there more than 4 different text/accent colors on screen?","pushes":"low","fix":"Cut the palette to one accent color."},{"meter":"vv","id":"vv7","q":"Is the page background near-black with a clashing palette (many hues or a vivid accent)?","yes":"Near-black background with a loud palette","w":20,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is the page background near-black with a clashing palette?","pushes":"low","fix":"Cut the palette to one accent against the dark background."},{"meter":"vv","id":"vv9","q":"Is the most-used accent color vivid (bright, fully saturated)?","yes":"The accent color is vivid.","w":27,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the most-used accent color vivid (bright, fully saturated)? Yes means: The accent color is vivid.","pushes":"high","fix":"Use a more vivid accent color."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi1","q":"Is the most-used accent color vivid (bright, fully saturated) rather than muted or pastel?","yes":"Saturation level is vivid","w":32,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is the most-used accent color vivid (bright, fully saturated) rather than muted or pastel?","pushes":"high","fix":"Desaturate the main accent."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi3","q":"Are there 4 or more separate colored blocks competing for attention?","yes":"4+ colored blocks","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Are there 4 or more separate colored blocks competing for attention?","pushes":"high","fix":"Reduce to one colored block."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi4","q":"Is there a full-width gradient, or a large (over a quarter of the screen) multicolor image or ribbon?","yes":"Large multicolor area present","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is there a full-width gradient, or a large (over a quarter of the screen) multicolor image or ribbon?","pushes":"high","fix":"Use a flat single-tone background."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi5","q":"Is the page mostly one hue family plus neutrals (grays, white, black)?","yes":"Palette is single hue plus neutrals","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is the page mostly one hue family plus neutrals (grays, white, black)?","pushes":"low","fix":"Keep it this way for calm."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi6","q":"Is the saturation of the largest colored area muted or pastel?","yes":"Saturation is muted","w":32,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Is the saturation of the largest colored area muted or pastel?","pushes":"low","fix":"Keep the muted tone for calm."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi7","q":"Does more than 40 percent of the screen stay empty (no text, image or color)?","yes":"Empty area over 40 percent","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Does more than 40 percent of the screen stay empty (no text, image or color)?","pushes":"low","fix":"Add whitespace to calm the page."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi8","q":"Are all headline weights regular or medium and no text is larger than 3 times body size?","yes":"No very large, ultra-bold type","w":4,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Are all headline weights regular or medium and no text is larger than 3 times body size?","pushes":"low","fix":"Lower headline weight and size."},{"meter":"vi","id":"vi9","q":"Is the page background dark (darker colors raise arousal)?","yes":"The main background is dark.","w":16,"kind":"code","jev":"Is this true of the screen? Is the page background dark (darker colors raise arousal)? Yes means: The main background is dark.","pushes":"high","fix":"Use a lighter background to calm the page."},{"meter":"cv","id":"cv1","q":"Does any headline or button name a benefit gained (save, grow, simple, free, easy, clear)?","yes":"At least one gain word in headline/button","w":16,"kind":"jev","jev":"Is this true? Does any headline or button name a benefit gained (save, grow, simple, free, easy, clear)?","pushes":"high","fix":"Lead the headline with what the reader gains."},{"meter":"cv","id":"cv3","q":"Do at least 3 words in the copy come f